  "content": "<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://ibb.co/xsnn6nf\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Extended Illumina</span> 由 </strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbeacons.ai%252filyastik\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ilyastik</a></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Extended Illumina 是一个资源包，它为手中的灯笼和火把添加了 3D 模型，非常适合沉浸式角色扮演体验。</strong></span></p>\n<p><em style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>Extended Illumina 不包含自定义模型或纹理，因此几乎适用于所有灯笼或火把资源包。</em></span></em></p>\n<p><em style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>推荐搭配 DYNAMIC LIGHTS 以获得更佳体验！</em></span></em></p>\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\n<p><strong>支持 Not Enough Animations：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/extended-illumina-not-enough-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extended Illumina (Not Enough Animations 版)</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>1.12 - 26.2</strong></p>\n<p>🧡</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
